  "description": "Voluntary overtime among the female employees has begun. When the strikingly handsome newcomer, Min-Jun Kim, becomes the center of every woman’s attention, the atmosphere in the office quickly turns heated. Soon, \"overtime\" becomes an enticing invitation none of them want to refuse — and the nights grow longer in more ways than one.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3587006836), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/shall_we_work_overtime), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/comic/C000053850), [Toomics](https://www.toomics.com/uplmscg/episode/toon/6771)\n\n**Official Translations:**    \nEnglish",
